# Python bytecode — regenerated on import, including inside vendor/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The repo root ignores bin/ for Java build output, and that pattern is unanchored,
# so it also swallows the vendored package's console-script directory. This is a
# shipped part of websocket-client, not build output — un-exclude the directory
# itself, which is the only way to re-include anything underneath it.
!vendor/bin/
